  "limitations": [
    "Within-cohort rank normalisation uses the complete unlabelled external expression distribution; the model is transductive and is not ready for single-sample deployment.",
    "The underlying METABRIC probe annotation and duplicate-probe summarisation were not rederived in this analysis.",
    "Sample-type metadata were unavailable (UNKNOWN) for all expression-list entries in both cohorts, so the workflow could not verify or restrict primary-tumour specimens.",
    "The Cox PCs are unsupervised components of the PAM50 gene-expression matrix; they are not intrinsic-subtype calls and not the commercial Prosigna assay.",
    "TCGA and METABRIC overall-survival time origins and event definitions still require source-level confirmation.",
    "IPCW metrics use a marginal censoring Kaplan-Meier model and assume independent censoring within the evaluation cohort.",
    "This retrospective external analysis does not establish clinical utility, prospective validity, treatment benefit or biological causality."
